{"type":"thought","data":"The TREE already implements"}
{"type":"thought","data":" much of this feature."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assumes a 2026-09-02"}
{"type":"thought","data":" baseline, but the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code already includes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" TRANSPORT_RE, collect(),"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the collect-report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verb. The audit targets"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design specification"}
{"type":"thought","data":" itself rather than "}
{"type":"thought","data":"code compliance."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design may be "}
{"type":"thought","data":"outdated relative to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current tree. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" audit must read the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tree first before making"}
{"type":"thought","data":" any assertions."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design's specific"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims about the tree"}
{"type":"thought","data":" — line numbers, signatures,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and behaviors — are"}
{"type":"thought","data":" what actually need "}
{"type":"thought","data":"verification. If those"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims are wrong relative"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to the current code,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that is a finding."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit surface "}
{"type":"thought","data":"may be a frozen historical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" snapshot from September"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2026. Auditing it against"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current October"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2026 code would flag"}
{"type":"thought","data":" every line-number drift"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as a finding. Alternatively,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design may describe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a feature already implemented"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the current tree."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is historical, dated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2026-09-02. The current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" codebase has evolved"}
{"type":"thought","data":" significantly since"}
{"type":"thought","data":" then. It now includes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unscorable reports,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `_deliver_report_file`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and `log_path`. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" audit should judge "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the design on its own"}
{"type":"thought","data":" consistency with its"}
{"type":"thought","data":" own specification and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" its claims about the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code that existed at"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the time it was written.\n\nThe audit must distinguish"}
{"type":"thought","data":" measurement findings"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from build findings."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Stale line numbers "}
{"type":"thought","data":"are measurement issues."}
{"type":"thought","data":" False behavioral assumptions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that would mislead "}
{"type":"thought","data":"an implementer are build"}
{"type":"thought","data":" issues. The rubric "}
{"type":"thought","data":"requires determining"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whether a 5d/5e implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would write different"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code or tests if the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" finding were fixed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nIf the feature is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"already implemented,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a 5d/5e implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would follow the design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" document as the specification"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than re-reading"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the evolved code. Stale"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line numbers only matter"}
{"type":"thought","data":" when they misdirect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" insertion points.\n\n"}
{"type":"thought","data":"The audit should focus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on three axes: internal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradictions in the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design, invariant breaches,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and acceptance criteria"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reconciliation."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nStale line numbers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are only design defects"}
{"type":"thought","data":" if they mislead an "}
{"type":"thought","data":"implementer about behavior."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The \"observed today\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" section is evidence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for assumptions, not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a specification itself."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The filename indicates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cycle1 despite the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"document being at v1.18,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" suggesting a versioning"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mismatch."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit will verify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design text against"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the tree. The first"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claim to check is the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `_collected_path` signature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and its return path"}
{"type":"thought","data":" format."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design incorrectly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims `_collected_path`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lacks a `surface` parameter."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The current code already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" includes it. This is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" dated evidence from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2026-09-02, not a claim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" about the current tree."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe assumption verification"}
{"type":"thought","data":" invariant requires "}
{"type":"thought","data":"assumptions to cite "}
{"type":"thought","data":"observed output. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design does cite dates,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but seven weeks of "}
{"type":"thought","data":"code evolution may have"}
{"type":"thought","data":" invalidated its contracts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for an implementer."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI am now comparing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current `_collect_unguarded`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implementation against"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design's proposed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `collect()` logic."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe current `_collect_unguarded`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only calls `_run_report_wait`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" when `grace > 0`. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design incorrectly "}
{"type":"thought","data":"requires this call unconditionally."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This contradicts AC-2.3,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which mandates a `MISSING`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verdict when `--grace"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 0` and the report file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exists but its `.done`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" marker is absent."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe current `_run_report_wait`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" enforces a one-second"}
{"type":"thought","data":" minimum timeout even"}
{"type":"thought","data":" when `grace` is zero."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This means the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code already waits "}
{"type":"thought","data":"at least one second "}
{"type":"thought","data":"for a `.done` marker,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which conflicts with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-2.3 requiring a "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`MISSING` verdict when"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `--grace 0` and the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" marker is absent."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe prior concern "}
{"type":"thought","data":"about a one-second minimum"}
{"type":"thought","data":" timeout may be unfounded."}
{"type":"thought","data":" If `report_wait` returns"}
{"type":"thought","data":" immediately when the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file exists but the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `.done` marker is absent,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current code already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" satisfies AC-2.3. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design's unconditional"}
{"type":"thought","data":" call to `_run_report_wait`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with `grace=0` would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still trigger this "}
{"type":"thought","data":"path, so the behavior"}
{"type":"thought","data":" may be consistent after"}
{"type":"thought","data":" all."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design explicitly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" states that the `.done`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" marker, not file existence,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" determines completion."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This raises the question"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of whether `report_wait`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" itself requires that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" marker.\n\nThe current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code skips `_run_report_wait`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" entirely when `grace`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is zero. This cleanly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" satisfies AC-2.3 by"}
{"type":"thought","data":" returning `none` immediately."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design lacks this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" guard and would instead"}
{"type":"thought","data":" invoke the wait function"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unconditionally."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe grace floor is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not a functional bug."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The current code still"}
{"type":"thought","data":" returns MISSING when"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the marker is absent,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" merely with a one-second"}
{"type":"thought","data":" delay. This is a behavior"}
{"type":"thought","data":" difference rather than"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a design defect unless"}
{"type":"thought","data":" report_wait succeeds"}
{"type":"thought","data":" without the marker."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will now examine "}
{"type":"thought","data":"collect(), gate(), and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design's error "}
{"type":"thought","data":"handling section to "}
{"type":"thought","data":"quote accurately."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design's `_readback_equal`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is missing the `try/except"}
{"type":"thought","data":" OSError` guard present"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the current code."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This omission means"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design would raise"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an exception if the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file vanishes between"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the `is_file()` check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the `read_bytes()`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" call, or if the file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exists but is unreadable."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design's `_finalize_write`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" places `mkdir(parents=True,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exist_ok=True)` inside"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the function itself,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whereas the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code leaves that call"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to the callers. Both"}
{"type":"thought","data":" approaches are valid."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design's OperationalError"}
{"type":"thought","data":" message for a stale"}
{"type":"thought","data":" marker reads `\"readback:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" marker still present:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" {marker}\"`. The CLI"}
{"type":"thought","data":" classifies this as "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`readback_failed` because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it checks if the error"}
{"type":"thought","data":" string starts with "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`\"readback\"`. This matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design's intent."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe current code's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" readback error string"}
{"type":"thought","data":" also begins with \"readback\","}
{"type":"thought","data":" so the CLI still classifies"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it as `readback_failed`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design's empty-report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" message correctly avoids"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this prefix.\n\nA major"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction has been"}
{"type":"thought","data":" found in the marker"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contract. The Error"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Handling Strategy section"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires exactly two"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `[H-MAD]` markers on"}
{"type":"thought","data":" every exit path. However,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" D2 and v1.2 state that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" every exit path carries"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exactly one `[H-MAD]`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" marker. These specifications"}
{"type":"thought","data":" directly conflict.\n\nThis contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a build issue. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implementer would emit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" either one or two markers,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and tests would assert"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whichever count was"}
{"type":"thought","data":" chosen. FR-2 describes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one marker line, but"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the acceptance criteria"}
{"type":"thought","data":" never explicitly mandates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exactly one versus "}
{"type":"thought","data":"two. The marker discipline"}
{"type":"thought","data":" invariant only requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" emitting `[H-MAD]` "}
