{"type":"thought","data":" are historical. Verifying"}
{"type":"thought","data":" these against the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tree would reveal massive"}
{"type":"thought","data":" drift. The audit's "}
{"type":"thought","data":"scope is unclear."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe filename reveals"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this is cycle 1 of "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a design audit. Normally,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cycle 1 reviews a design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" document before implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" begins. The current"}
