{"type":"thought","data":" the proposed changes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and additional evolution."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This suggests the audit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" may be reviewing a "}
{"type":"thought","data":"document that predates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the existing implementation."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit likely has"}
{"type":"thought","data":" two purposes. It may"}
{"type":"thought","data":" evaluate the design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" text for internal inconsistencies,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or it may flag that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design's \"observed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" today\" baseline is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"stale relative to the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" current codebase. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design cites a September"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2026 date while the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code already contains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" transport and reporting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" features, confirming"}
{"type":"thought","data":" its assumption table"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is outdated."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nStale line numbers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are only evidence of"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code location, not "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the implementation specification."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The D1-D5 code blocks"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are the true spec. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"However, some behavioral"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims in the design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are now false and would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cause an implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to write code that "}
{"type":"thought","data":"breaks the current platform."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe PassSpec audit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claim is still accurate."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The current constructor"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires out_path and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" defaults only log_path"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to None, so the design's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" positional field ordering"}
{"type":"thought","data":" remains correct."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design's claim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that `collect()` returns"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only `(delivered, collected_path)`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with delivered in `{\"report-file\",\"out\",\"none\"}`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is false. The current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code also returns `unscorable:<reason>`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tokens. Rewriting `collect()`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" per the design's `_collect_unguarded`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would drop the unscorable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" screen."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe unscorable screen"}
{"type":"thought","data":" was added after the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design was approved."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The audit therefore"}
{"type":"thought","data":" flags the design for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not accounting for "}
{"type":"thought","data":"later code. This is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a valid design defect."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFlagging the design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for not accounting "}
{"type":"thought","data":"for later code is wrong."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The audit should verify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whether the \"observed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" today\" claims were "}
{"type":"thought","data":"accurate at the time"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of writing and whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" they still match the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" current platform. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" effort contract requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reading the tree before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" asserting what is in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it. Flagging a historical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" baseline mismatch would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cause every historical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design to fail forever."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design's code "}
{"type":"thought","data":"blocks present complete"}
{"type":"thought","data":" new functions rather"}
{"type":"thought","data":" than patches. A 5d "}
{"type":"thought","data":"implementer would overwrite"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current `collect()`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" entirely and destroy"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unscorable handling"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and grace-period short-circuits."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit should judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tree. The document "}
{"type":"thought","data":"is dangerously incomplete"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for this codebase and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would regress later"}
{"type":"thought","data":" behavior if implemented"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as written."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit should judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design against "}
{"type":"thought","data":"four criteria: internal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" consistency, invariants,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec acceptance criteria"}
{"type":"thought","data":" coverage, and claims"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that are false about"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the code as the design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" describes it. Using"}
{"type":"thought","data":" later code to judge"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a historical design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a false finding "}
{"type":"thought","data":"if the document accurately"}
{"type":"thought","data":" described its own era."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Git history will be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" checked to compare "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the design's last update"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with the unscorable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" feature's addition."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The D1 code block will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" also be re-read.\n\nThe audit should focus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on internal contradictions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and false claims about"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the code as it existed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at the time of writing."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design does not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" need to anticipate "}
{"type":"thought","data":"later features."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design file on"}
{"type":"thought","data":" disk will be checked"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against the prompt."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Internal contradictions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are being sought in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the error handling "}
{"type":"thought","data":"strategy and D2/D3 sections."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Each acceptance criterion"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be reviewed systematically."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA confirmed contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" has emerged: the Error"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Handling Strategy claims"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exactly two markers,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while D2 and version"}
{"type":"thought","data":" history v1.2 claim "}
{"type":"thought","data":"exactly one.\n\nD3's exit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code and signal discipline"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is also under scrutiny."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit code 2 for GATE:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" INVALID on a readable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" transport file. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" existing gate already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" returns 2 for missing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sections, treating "}
{"type":"thought","data":"them as operational "}
{"type":"thought","data":"errors rather than verdicts."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This aligns with the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" base invariant that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" permits non-zero exits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only for genuine operational"}
{"type":"thought","data":" errors."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design treats "}
{"type":"thought","data":"transport refusal as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an operational error,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" yet the base invariant"}
{"type":"thought","data":" restricts exit code"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2 to genuine operational"}
{"type":"thought","data":" errors. The Error Handling"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Strategy and Invariant"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Compliance sections"}
{"type":"thought","data":" both claim GATE: INVALID"}
{"type":"thought","data":" keeps its existing "}
{"type":"thought","data":"exit 2. This is a direct"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe existing gate "}
{"type":"thought","data":"treats missing sections"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as an operational error"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to prevent \"no report\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" from reading as \"no"}
{"type":"thought","data":" findings.\" Refusing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a well-formed report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a policy verdict,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not an operational "}
{"type":"thought","data":"error. The orchestrator"}
{"type":"thought","data":" consumes GATE: INVALID"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as a verdict and maps"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it to UNVERIFIED, so"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit code 2 for transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" refusal would breach"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the invariant.\n\nThe design explicitly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" treats exit code 2 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"for GATE: INVALID as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a consumed verdict,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mapping it to UNVERIFIED."}
