{"type":"thought","data":"SKILL.md 6.6 literal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" does not match the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"design."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design expects"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `audit_<feature>_<phase>_cycle<N>.report.md`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but SKILL.md line 2847"}
{"type":"thought","data":" uses `_run$RUN` instead."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The question is whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that suffix still matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the TRANSPORT_RE pattern."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe `_run$RUN` suffix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still matches TRANSPORT_RE"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because the stem remains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" dot-free. The design's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claim that the test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reads the literal from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the file by regex is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" therefore valid."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design was written"}
{"type":"thought","data":" before the transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" name was updated to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" include `_run$RUN`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" If the test regex expects"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the original shorter"}
{"type":"thought","data":" literal, it will fail"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file. This suggests"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a design defect."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design's claim"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that the 6.6 literal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is instantiated with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sample tokens and asserted"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to match TRANSPORT_RE"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a false premise."}
{"type":"thought","data":" An implementer following"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this specification "}
{"type":"thought","data":"would search for a string"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that does not exist"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the current file."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThis is load-bearing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for AC-3.5a. The grammar"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must match the recipe's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" live output. A test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that pins the old literal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would pass against "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a stale string instead"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of the current `_run$RUN`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" name, allowing future"}
{"type":"thought","data":" changes to break the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contract."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe test would fail"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file, forcing the implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to update either the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test or notice the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"drift. Correcting this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would change the expected"}
{"type":"thought","data":" literal and regex to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" include `_run$RUN`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is a must-fix "}
{"type":"thought","data":"because the design's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-3.5a pin targets"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a stale string that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" no longer matches the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" recipe's actual output."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe dot-free stem "}
{"type":"thought","data":"still satisfies TRANSPORT_RE,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so the guard itself"}
{"type":"thought","data":" remains valid. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"test cannot be written"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file because the expected"}
{"type":"thought","data":" span is absent. I will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verify the exact 6.6"}
{"type":"thought","data":" string and confirm "}
{"type":"thought","data":"whether the current "}
{"type":"thought","data":"recipe's staged --report-file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still matches TRANSPORT_RE."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe `$RUN` variable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" expands to a timestamp"}
{"type":"thought","data":" without dots, so the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" runtime filename still"}
{"type":"thought","data":" satisfies TRANSPORT_RE."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design's false "}
{"type":"thought","data":"literal is therefore"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a real test defect."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I am now weighing whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this should be a must-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or a should-fix, since"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-3.5a does not quote"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the exact RP string."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe test cannot pass"}
{"type":"thought","data":" without updating the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design to match the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" current SKILL.md literal."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will quote the exact"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design sentence and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the corresponding SKILL.md"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe codex recipe path"}
{"type":"thought","data":" also omits the `_run$RUN`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" suffix. The design's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" new section proposes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the old naming without"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that suffix. I will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verify whether the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"staged `--report-file`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still matches `TRANSPORT_RE`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design's new codex-leg"}
{"type":"thought","data":" recipe omits the RUN"}
{"type":"thought","data":" token that 6.6 requires."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Without minting a fresh"}
{"type":"thought","data":" RUN, dispatches could"}
{"type":"thought","data":" collide on report or"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prompt paths. This "}
{"type":"thought","data":"suggests the design "}
{"type":"thought","data":"may be stale, or it "}
{"type":"thought","data":"may intentionally use"}
