{"type":"thought","data":"2 wording in AC-3.1 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and the marker sentence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in FR-2."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nFound a contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the spec. FR-2 says"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one contract line and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one marker. D2 says"}
