{"type":"thought","data":" Error Handling says"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exactly two. AC-2.1"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only covers the contract"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe \"exactly two\" "}
{"type":"thought","data":"marker count is an Axis"}
{"type":"thought","data":" A contradiction. It"}
{"type":"thought","data":" creates a hard gap "}
{"type":"thought","data":"because tests assert"}
{"type":"thought","data":" either one or two markers."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will raise it as "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a Must-fix without tying"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it to a specific AC,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" since the FR description"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is not an AC."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-3.1 is restated."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design code block"}
{"type":"thought","data":" returns exit 1, but"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec requires exit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2. AC-2.9 step (i) "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and AC-3.3 also require"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit 2. The design "}
{"type":"thought","data":"contains both the spec"}
{"type":"thought","data":" form and a narrower"}
{"type":"thought","data":" divergent form."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-3.1 is self-contradictory"}
{"type":"thought","data":" coverage. The operative"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code block returns "}
{"type":"thought","data":"exit 1, not the spec's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" required exit 2. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" makes it a restated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC rather than implemented-as-written."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The prose matches the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec, but the code "}
{"type":"thought","data":"diverges."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-2.11 is restated."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design narrows "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the spec by excluding"}
{"type":"thought","data":" empty pairs and pins"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this behavior with "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a test absent from the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec.\n\nAC-2.8 is also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" restated. The design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" adds existence-blind"}
{"type":"thought","data":" handling, so a missing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file no longer falls"}
{"type":"thought","data":" through to --out."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-2.8 is implemented-as-written,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not restated. The design's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" extra sentence merely"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spells out a consequence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" already required by"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec.\n\nAC-3.3 matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec exactly when"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rc is 2. It is implemented-as-written."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-1.5 is implemented-as-written."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design uses exactly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one function to build"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the path, matching "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the spec.\n\nAC-2.4 is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" also implemented-as-written."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design returns "}
{"type":"thought","data":"without writing when"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the docs file is already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" present and byte-identical,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which satisfies the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec requirement."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe already-collected"}
{"type":"thought","data":" short-circuit in AC-2.4"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only triggers for non-empty"}
{"type":"thought","data":" identical files. Empty"}
{"type":"thought","data":" identical pairs bypass"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it, so they fall through"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to report_wait and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"may reach the out rung"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or end up MISSING."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nEmpty identical pairs"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with --out trigger "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a CONFLICT verdict because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the existing empty "}
{"type":"thought","data":"docs file is not overwritten."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Without --out, they"}
{"type":"thought","data":" end MISSING. The design's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" edge-case text omits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the --out condition."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design's edge-case"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claim that empty-identical"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pairs end MISSING is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only true when --out"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is absent. If --out"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is present, the pair"}
{"type":"thought","data":" falls through to the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" out rung instead. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" creates a test mismatch:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a pinned test expecting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" MISSING would fail "}
{"type":"thought","data":"if it also passes --out,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or the design overclaims."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-5.3 is implemented-as-written."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design gate line"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is awkward but omits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the required $RP variable."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe D5 recipe comment"}
{"type":"thought","data":" about halting on non-OK"}
{"type":"thought","data":" COLLECT tokens matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec's halt marker"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requirement."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe D5 recipe uses"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `--timeout 1800` as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an `hmad-dispatch exec`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" flag. This is the allowed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" form under the invariant,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not the forbidden `timeout"}
{"type":"thought","data":" <s> <cmd>` pattern."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design's claim "}
{"type":"thought","data":"that portable time bounds"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are compliant is correct."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe hardcoded path"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the D5 recipe is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" permitted because `~/.claude/skills/h-mad`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a documented host"}
{"type":"thought","data":" install location. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" \"no timeout\" compliance"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claim is imprecise "}
{"type":"thought","data":"but acceptable."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe contradiction "}
{"type":"thought","data":"remains a hard gap for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the test. The design's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prose chooses exit "}
{"type":"thought","data":"2 to match the existing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" INVALID verdict, which"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the codebase treats"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as operational. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gate contract and gate()"}
{"type":"thought","data":" function already accept"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit 2 as a valid verdict"}
{"type":"thought","data":" channel, so this is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not a separate invariant"}
{"type":"thought","data":" breach."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe code comment says"}
{"type":"thought","data":" narrowing away from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit 2 converts UNVERIFIED"}
{"type":"thought","data":" into an operational"}
{"type":"thought","data":" error. The spec requires"}
