eport-file, the report \"\n","total_lines":776}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"thought","data":"The assemble script "}
{"type":"thought","data":"halts if a report path"}
{"type":"thought","data":" was already claimed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe claim marker lives"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in `~/.cache/h-mad/handed`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not next to the report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file. The D5 recipe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" deletes only the report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and its `.done` marker,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so the assemble script"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still sees the old "}
{"type":"thought","data":"claim and halts."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design forbids"}
{"type":"thought","data":" modifying the assemble"}
{"type":"thought","data":" script, yet its recipe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" calls it. The recipe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" was likely written "}
{"type":"thought","data":"before the claim-once"}
{"type":"thought","data":" guard was added, so"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it is now incompatible"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with the current platform."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe `_halt_handed`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" function returns exit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code 0 even when it"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prints `ASSEMBLE: HALT`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design's recipe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ignores both the halt"}
{"type":"thought","data":" message and the non-zero"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit code, so it proceeds"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to `hmad-dispatch exec`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" regardless of whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assemble actually failed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe recipe assumes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assemble will write"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the prompt to a reused"}
{"type":"thought","data":" report path. The current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assembler will not "}
{"type":"thought","data":"after the first claim,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so this is a false "}
{"type":"thought","data":"premise.\n\nThis is a "}
{"type":"thought","data":"build-class gap. An "}
{"type":"thought","data":"implementer writing "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the D5 SKILL.md block"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would ship a recipe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that assemble refuses"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on the second cycle."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The code or documentation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would need to change"}
{"type":"thought","data":" if the finding were"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe recipe cannot "}
{"type":"thought","data":"be re-run for the same"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cycle because the report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" path includes the cycle"}
{"type":"thought","data":" number. A new cycle"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a new path, so it"}
{"type":"thought","data":" avoids the claim guard."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Re-dispatching the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"same cycle reuses the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" path and halts. Section"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 6.6 states that minting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a fresh RUN is the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"only guard against path"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reuse."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design's report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" path omits the RUN "}
{"type":"thought","data":"identifier, so re-running"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the same cycle halts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while minting a fresh"}
{"type":"thought","data":" RUN would succeed. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"This is a genuine gap"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because operators re-run"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cycles. The audit instruction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires checking claims"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tree."}
